{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","id":3716904052,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7di3R0","number":113867,"title":"Disabling the CollisionShape2D in the editor drastically improves the loading time","user":{"login":"Rinkton","id":57531521,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTMxNTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57531521?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton","html_url":"https://github.com/Rinkton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2025-12-10T21:53:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T18:46:29Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.5.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot 4.5.1.stable - Vulkan(Forward+)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI'm working on the project which loading **many CharacterBody2D** nodes which have **enabled** CollisionShape2D-s as the children in each one on the start of the game. \n\nIt was taking pretty long, but suddenly I've discovered for myself that if I will disable CollisionShape2D's in these CharacterBody2D-s in the editor and then will write in their `_ready` func \n``` gdscript\n$CollisionShape2D.set_deferred(\"disabled\", false)\n```\nthen everything will work as before(at least in my situation), but the loading time will be improved drastically(e.g. in the game itself it will be loading 2s instead of 20s).\n\nI firstly published this issue in the godot-docs repository: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/issues/11522 . But the people there said me that it might be \"legitimate performance issue\".\n\nP.S. For the StaticBody2D it wasn't that noticeable, so I guess it isn't actual for this.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Download MRP\n2. In the `character_body_2d.tscn` in the editor uncheck `disabled` for the `CollisionShape2D`. It will cause `main.tscn` load longer than if leave it checked.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[cs2d_disabled_performance_boost.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24041065/cs2d_disabled_performance_boost.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}